Coffee_Delivery
agents: R1, H1, H2
locations: kitchen, loading_area, bedroom, office001
resources: coffee
robots: R1
humans: H1, H2
R1:
	1: moveTo kitchen
	2: pick coffee
	3: moveTo loading_area
	4: deposit coffee
	5: moveTo bedroom if position(R1,bedroom) else stop
	6: moveTo office001 if position(R1,office001) else stop
H1:
	1: moveTo kitchen
	2: wait until position(R1,kitchen)
	3: moveTo loading_area
	4: wait until position(R1,loading_area)
	5: moveTo bedroom if position(H1,bedroom) else stop
	6: moveTo office001 if position(H1,office001) else stop
H2:
	1: moveTo kitchen
	2: wait until position(R1,kitchen)
	3: moveTo loading_area
	4: wait until position(R1,loading_area)
	5: moveTo bedroom if position(H2,bedroom) else stop
	6: moveTo office001 if position(H2,office001) else stop
